  https://github.com/abrignoni/iLEAPP

dict_ileapp_zh.json and extracted.json contain short factual strings
(artifact names, category names, table header names) extracted from iLEAPP
source code with extract_metadata.py, together with their Chinese
translations. They are distributed here for interoperability, with
attribution to the upstream project above.
